TITLE Kinetic dissolution of Albite in pH 2 solution with Fe2/Fe3 and H2S(g)
SOLUTION 1
    temp 200
    pH 2 charge
    units mmol/kgw
    Fe(+3) 4
    Fe(+2) 4

GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 5
    H2S(g) 5

KINETICS 1
    Albite
        -m0 1.0
        -m  1.0
        -parms 1.0 10
        -steps 1000 in 100
        -tol 1e-12

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
    -time true
    -step true
    -ionic_strength true
END